{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":661605,\"title\":\"Undercover\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"October 2015. French customs seize seven tonnes of cannabis in the heart of the capital. The same day, Hubert Antoine, a former mole with a shady past, contacts Stéphane Vilner, a journalist at Libération. He claims to be able to demonstrate the existence of State drug trafficking led by Jacques Billard, prominent media figure and high-ranking French police officer. Suspicious at first, the young journalist finally dives into an investigation that will lead him to the darkest corners of the Republic.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXGWSH09gLpRKdKloeHXuVAuBaU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tSs4jDqLkHQSoQGK0uniBgs7FwS.jpg\",\"rating\":4.9,\"voteCount\":126,\"year\":2022,\"runtime\":123,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":1610009,\"director\":\"Thierry de Peretti\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":550418,\"name\":\"Thierry de Peretti\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w3ERYv9QXHHQRjVU8PEPYWTNJGt.jpg\"},{\"id\":20442,\"name\":\"Roschdy Zem\",\"character\":\"Hubert Antoine\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kx6FWwIKPDxFg3KNhGwctEjqWxX.jpg\"},{\"id\":146287,\"name\":\"Pio Marmaï\",\"character\":\"Stéphane Vilner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3DlfGGHAcJUI5pHzDBYQz7JsxoM.jpg\"},{\"id\":5443,\"name\":\"Vincent Lindon\",\"character\":\"Jacques Billard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tjRKMKfsIH7MrqtN7cMPIZubSXa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1695211,\"name\":\"Julie Moulier\",\"character\":\"Julie Mondoloni\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t8Eaeed1bA7mCkolho9PLTdcymv.jpg\"},{\"id\":1710851,\"name\":\"Alexis Manenti\",\"character\":\"Alexis Novinard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n9YW0FkKhxlwMhFQz3U2OokuWFZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":195683